OL,4,CSearch charity welcomes mobile signal  
OL,5,Cinitiative                             
OL,6,GA search and rescue charity has        
OL,7,Gwelcomed an initiative aiming to help  
OL,8,Gimprove mobile connectivity for teams  
OL,9,Goperating across the UK.               
OL,11,FBerkshire Lowland Search and Rescue    
OL,12,F(BLSAR), which uses an app that relies 
OL,13,Fon GPS and internet access, said       
OL,14,Fcoverage can often be inconsistent in  
OL,15,Fthe rural locations where search teams 
OL,16,Fare frequently deployed, which risks   
OL,17,F"losing time in deploying".            
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
