OL,4,CWorld War Two field gun a step closer  
OL,5,Cto new home                            
OL,6,GPlans for a historic 25-pounder field  
OL,7,Ggun used during World War Two have     
OL,8,Gtaken a step closer to the landmark    
OL,9,Ggoing on display again.                
OL,11,FRushmoor Borough Council said 585      
OL,12,Fpeople had completed a recent survey   
OL,13,Fon the future location of Aldershot's  
OL,14,FBritish Artillery field gun.           
OL,16,FThe Hampshire authority said the gun's 
OL,17,Fformer site at the town's railway      
OL,18,Fstation was most popular, with Princes 
OL,19,FGardens receiving the second highest   
OL,20,Fvote.                                  
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
